      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: <SFX_liezel_wondering>Thank you for the information.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: <SFX_ate_guard_thinking>The other night, Sir Solomon and Sir Lapuz made
        a big commotion in the main building.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: They were yelling so loudly the entire outpost probably would have heard
        it, not that there were that many other people around.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[3]'
      value: "<SFX_ate_guard_sigh>I couldn\u2019t tell what they were arguing about
        from out here, but it sounded serious."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[4]'
      value: "That\u2019s all I know, and you didn\u2019t hear it from me."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: conditionalObjectsToCheckAfter.Array.size
      value: 0
