      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 9041903786073183966, guid: 09fbf670f6b1442b3895d0264e1b949c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: <i>(I assume that this is the rope to be pulled for the bell to ring.
        Currently, it seems to not be in the right condition to be rung.)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 9041903786073183966, guid: 09fbf670f6b1442b3895d0264e1b949c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: <i>(One purpose of a rope is to be pulled, such as in this case, so
        there should probably be some weight to pull first. Then, pulling it should
        be able to make the bell sound like normal.)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
